@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, row VN-27: Chapter II Section 2 (the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund,
-- Articles 14-22) and Chapter V (Articles 61-75: chiefly Article 75, the insurer's duties), as
-- they bear on the compulsory insurance of motor vehicle owners' civil liability, in both
-- vintages (as made; as amended by Decree 220/2026/NĐ-CP).
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every other module of this row reaches them through the
-- import chain (nouns -> general -> fund-art14-16 -> fund-art17 -> fund-art18-22 ->
-- ch5-authorities -> art75; the test and findings modules import art75 only).
--
-- Sources (NOTES.md §0 and encoding.json give url and sha256):
--   src:N                         line N of ../../source/raw/nd67-congbao-1017-1018.txt
--   src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:N  line N of ../../source/raw/nd67-congbao-1019-1020.txt
--   src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:N  line N of ../../source/raw/nd220-2026-congbao-367.txt
-- Every `src:` line is printed by tools/vnsrc.py from that line; none is typed by hand.
--
-- This row is self-contained: it does not import row VN-10 (Articles 5-13), and repeats the
-- few things it needs from those Articles under its own names. NOTES.md §1.3 says how a
-- caller joins the two rows.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese đồng (VND), a bare NUMBER, unless a name says "in millions of dong"
-- (the unit Form 1 of Annex X reports in). Rates are percent figures as the source prints them
-- (31 means 31%), unless a name says "share".
-- Membership test: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to each fact, or a
-- certificate, a police, medical or assessment record, an account or a decision records it.
-- Whether a fact makes money payable or a duty owed is a rule, in the module for its Article.

§ `Nouns for the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund and the duties of insurers`

§§ `The vintage`

-- Decree 67/2023 is in force from the day it was signed, 6 September 2023:
-- src:16 | Số: 67/2023/NĐ-CP Hà Nội, ngày 06 tháng 9 năm 2023
-- src:2009 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành kể từ ngày ký ban hành.
-- Decree 220/2026 is in force from 1 July 2026:
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:195 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành từ ngày 01 tháng 7 năm 2026.
DECLARE `A vintage of the decree` IS ONE OF
    `the decree as made`
    `the decree as amended by Decree 220/2026`

§§ `Working days`

-- Article 62(5) counts a period in working days ("ngày làm việc") and the decree does not say
-- which days those are (NOTES.md, fork V5). Saturdays and Sundays are taken as non-working; the
-- caller supplies every other day off (public holidays).
DECLARE `A calendar of working days` HAS
    `days off other than Saturdays and Sundays` IS A LIST OF DATE

§§ `The person harmed, and the vehicle that caused the harm (Article 17(1)(a))`

-- The harm the humanitarian support of Article 17(1)(a) pays for: a death, or an injury at an
-- assessed rate ("tỷ lệ tổn thương"). The rate is a fact of the medical assessment, in percent;
-- the decree does not say who assesses it for the Fund (fork V9).
-- src:498 | thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại) với mức hỗ trợ cụ thể như sau: 30% giới hạn trách
-- src:499 | nhiệm bảo hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường
-- src:500 | hợp tử vong và tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 81% trở lên; 10% giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo
-- src:501 | hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường hợp tỷ lệ
-- src:502 | tổn thương từ 31% đến dưới 81%.
DECLARE `The harm to the person` IS ONE OF
    `death`
    `an injury assessed at a rate of` HAS `injury rate in percent` IS A NUMBER

-- The insurer's answer on the person's harm under Article 7 (row VN-10 computes it; NOTES.md
-- §1.3 maps VN-10's `The answer on cover` onto these members one to one). The exclusions are
-- the points of Article 7(2), the point (a) split by whose intentional act it was, because
-- Article 17(1)(a) treats the injured person's own intent apart.
-- src:198 | 1. Phạm vi bảo hiểm
