-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:2699 | Chúng tôi xin đảm bảo những thông tin trên là đúng sự thực.
DECLARE `A way of sending a report` IS ONE OF
    `by hand`
    `by postal service`
    `by email`
    `through the Ministry of Finance's reporting information system`

-- The vehicle lines of Form 1, as the form prints them (Roman numerals I-VI).
DECLARE `A vehicle line of Form 1` IS ONE OF
    `I two-wheeled motorcycles`
    `II three-wheeled motorcycles, mopeds and similar motor vehicles`
    `III cars not used for transport business`
    `IV cars used for transport business`
    `V goods vehicles (trucks)`
    `VI other vehicles`

-- Every column of Form 1 is printed twice, for the beginning and for the end of the period (the
-- form's sub-heads, split over lines 2676-2677 of nd67-congbao-1019-1020.txt).
DECLARE `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period` HAS
    `at the beginning of the period` IS A NUMBER
    `at the end of the period`       IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `The figures of a line of Form 1` HAS
    `number of vehicles`                               IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
    `premium, in millions of dong`                     IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
    `number of accidents`                              IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
    `number of deaths`                                 IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
    `compensation for persons, in millions of dong`    IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
    `compensation for property, in millions of dong`   IS A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`

DECLARE `A line of Form 1` HAS
    `vehicle line` IS A `A vehicle line of Form 1`
    `figures`      IS A `The figures of a line of Form 1`

DECLARE `A report on Form 1` HAS
    `the reporting year` IS A NUMBER
    `lines`              IS A LIST OF `A line of Form 1`
    `the total`          IS A `The figures of a line of Form 1`

§§ `Parties and acts of the regulative rules`

DECLARE `A party under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` IS ONE OF
    `the insurance enterprise`
    `the buyer or the insured`
    `the Fund's Management Council`
    `the Fund's Executive Board`
    `the traffic police or the investigating police`

DECLARE `An act under Articles 16 to 22, 62 and 75` IS ONE OF
    `pay into the Fund's account` HAS `the amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `decide the contribution rate, and notify it to the insurers and the Ministry of Finance`
    `urge the insurer to pay, or recover the contribution`
    `send the audited annual settlement report to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers`
    `publish the whole audited annual settlement report on the Association's website`
    `notify the budget, once approved or adjusted, to the Ministry of Finance and the insurers`
    `provide copies of the police documents on the accident`
    `send the Ministry of Finance the report on Form 1 of Annex X` HAS `the reporting year` IS A NUMBER
    `offer a promotion or a payment discount on the compulsory motor insurance`
    `explain the insurance, and how it differs from voluntary insurance`
    `gather the claim documents that are the insurer's to gather`
    `pay the advance and the compensation promptly and accurately`
    `pay the police the cost of copying the accident files provided`
    `disclose what it learns in the course of the investigation`
    `notify the buyer and the insured that the insurance is about to expire`
    `account separately for the compulsory insurance`
    `provide and update information in the database as the Council requires`

§§ `Results and problems`

-- The case of Article 17(1)(a) that makes humanitarian support payable.
-- src:495 | Trong các trường hợp không xác định được xe gây tai nạn, xe không tham gia
-- src:496 | bảo hiểm, không thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm và các trường hợp loại trừ trách nhiệm
-- src:497 | bảo hiểm theo quy định tại khoản 2 Điều 7 Nghị định này (trừ hành động cố ý gây
-- src:498 | thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại) với mức hỗ trợ cụ thể như sau: 30% giới hạn trách
DECLARE `A case of Article 17(1)(a)` IS ONE OF
    `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`
    `the vehicle was not insured`
    `the harm is outside the scope of the insurance`
    `an exclusion of Article 7(2) applies, other than the injured person's own intentional act`

-- The answer on humanitarian support for one person: an amount and the case, or a named
-- reason there is none.
DECLARE `Humanitarian support under Article 17(1)(a)` IS ONE OF
    `support of` HAS `amount` IS A NUMBER, `the case` IS A `A case of Article 17(1)(a)`
    `no support: none of the cases of Article 17(1)(a)`
    `no support: an injury rate under 31%`

-- What the Fund owes an insurer that advanced compensation (Article 17(1)(a), second
-- paragraph), or a named reason it owes nothing.
DECLARE `The Fund's duty to repay an advance` IS ONE OF
    `the Fund must repay` HAS `amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no duty: the advance was paid under point (a) of Article 12(3)`
    `no duty: the accident was later found within the scope and not excluded`

-- When the Fund pays a humanitarian support file, given the ceiling of Article 17(1)(a).
DECLARE `When a humanitarian support file is paid` IS ONE OF
    `within this year's ceiling`
    `carried to the next year's humanitarian support`

-- What Articles 75(1) and 8(2) find wrong with an offer.
DECLARE `A defect of an offer` IS ONE OF
    `Article 75(1): a promotion is offered with the compulsory cover`
    `Article 75(1): a payment discount is offered`
    `Article 75(1): the premium is reduced on a ground Article 8(2) does not give`
    `Article 8(2): the premium is adjusted by more than 15% of the Annex I premium`
    `Article 8(2): the premium is raised on a ground Article 8(2) does not give`

-- Invalid input, rejected rather than answered (EITHER, left side): the caller can fix it.
DECLARE `A defect in the facts given` IS ONE OF
    `an injury rate is not between 0 and 100`
    `no vehicle is named as having caused the harm`
    `the Council's rate exceeds the 1% of Article 16(1)`
    `an amount is negative`
    `the notice is dated after the insurance ended`
